  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-temperature-anomaly-mapping:\n\n- Calculates and maps temperature anomalies relative to multi-year climatic baselines.\n- Provides both standard and standardized anomalies for cross-seasonal/regional intensity comparison.\n- Classifies anomaly levels into warm/cold/severe classes based on statistical thresholds, output as class rasters.\n- Supports both real multi-epoch GeoTIFF input and offline synthetic data generation with verification mode.\n- Outputs include anomaly GeoTIFFs, class GeoTIFF, per-epoch statistics as JSON, and a run manifest. \n- Fully offline operation; no user data uploaded or network requests made.",
